   "text": "Block All New Oil Exports Act or the BAN Oil Exports Act\n This bill amends the Energy Policy and Conservation Act to require the President to ban the exportation of crude oil and natural gas from the United States.\n The President may provide an exemption to the requirement in specified circumstances."
